like launch exhaust.

05:21.673 --> 05:23.163
<i>That bastard!
That was my idea!</i>

05:23.274 --> 05:26.073
<i>He stole it!
I was gonna do that to my penis!</i>

05:26.178 --> 05:27.975
<i>Oh, well, maybe I can do something else.</i>

05:28.080 --> 05:30.480
<i>Like, like, like the Space Needle.</i>

05:30.649 --> 05:33.813
<i>Or a banana. Or a Sharpie.</i>

05:34.154 --> 05:36.884
<i>I'm boring myself.
Guess I'll listen to some music.</i>

05:36.990 --> 05:39.050
<i>'Cause I love a rainy night</i>

05:40.595 --> 05:42.620
<i>Yeah, I love a rainy night</i>

05:56.513 --> 05:58.174
Man, that really makes me mad.

05:58.282 --> 06:00.147
Illegal immigrants coming into
this country,

06:00.251 --> 06:02.720
